    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a hammer located on the top side and a pizza positioned on the right side. For every bowl in the image, there is a lighter to its left and a spoon aligned horizontally with it. Furthermore, the lighter is vertically aligned with the hammer, and the spoon is vertically aligned with the pizza.",
